},{y}_{2},…,{y}_{n}}$ is given by \n\n$$\n\\text{Cov}(x,y)=\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}({x}_{i}-\\overset{―}{x})({y}_{i}-\\overset{―}{y}),\n$$\n\nwhere $\\overset{―}{x}=\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i}$ and $\\overset{―}{y}=\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{y}_{i}$ are the means of the data sets.\n\nTherefore, the covariance of our data sets is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Cov}(x,y) & =\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}({x}_{i}-\\overset{―}{x})({y}_{i}-\\overset{―}{y}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[(2-5)(1-4)+(4-5)(3-4)+(6-5)(5-4)+(8-5)(7-4)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[(-3)(-3)+(-1)(-1)+(1)(1)+(3)(3)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[9+1+1+9] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 20 \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533956 true] [17592186268635 1000 #edb/ref 17592186268636 13194139533956 true] [17592186268635 1000 #edb/ref 17592186268637 13194139533956 true] [17592186268635 1000 #edb/ref 17592186268638 13194139533956 true] [17592186268635 1000 #edb/ref 17592186268639 13194139533956 true] [17592186268635 1000 #edb/ref 17592186268640 13194139533956 true] [17592186268635 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533956 true] [17592186268635 1041 "selection" 13194139533956 true] [17592186268635 1104 #edb/ref 17592186268640 13194139533956 true] [17592186268635 1110 #uuid "e9733944-17fd-59a6-8532-24aff31f0818" 13194139533956 true] [17592186268636 1034 "3" 13194139533956 true] [17592186268636 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533956 true] [17592186268636 1111 #uuid "2c266e4d-623b-5d7a-a532-bad180accf60" 13194139533956 true] [17592186268637 1034 "2" 13194139533956 true] [17592186268637 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533956 true] [17592186268637 1111 #uuid "2e60c538-e065-596f-b881-fef12275f200" 13194139533956 true] [17592186268638 1034 "6" 13194139533956 true] [17592186268638 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533956 true] [17592186268638 1111 #uuid "c12559eb-573e-538b-95e8-7948944a67ab" 13194139533956 true] [17592186268639 1034 "4" 13194139533956 true] [17592186268639 1103 #edb/ref 1759218604545